Package: ecommercescraping
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pip, python3-requests, python3-bs4, python3-pandas
Maintainer: Waleed
Description: E-commerce Web Scraping Service with REST API
 This package installs a complete web scraping system.
 It extracts product data from an e-commerce website,
 cleans it, and serves it via FastAPI on port 8000.
 The service starts automatically on boot.
